# The freeform `Other` choice, typed into and answered, then a second question
# refused with Escape. fx cancels the turn at that Escape; xfx declines the
# question and the model is told so with the tool's own sentinel, so xfx's
# gateway serves the turn after it ("after cancel.") and fx's never asks.
gateway question-other.json
wait 3
type ask me
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap q
key Down Down
wait 0.4
snap q-other
type MariaDB please
wait 0.4
snap q-typed
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap answered
type ask again
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap q2
key Escape
wait 3
snap q2-esc
snapfull end
gwlog
